                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Medicaid and CHIP are on the chopping block under the Republican plan to give the uber wealthy record tax breaks.\n\n In CA-12, nearly 150,000 of my constituents risk losing coverage. \n\nOver 40,000 of them are children under the age of 19 and almost 20,000 are seniors.",
